<title>SWITZERLAND: FIGURE SKATING-WORLD CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS.</title>
<headline>FIGURE SKATING-WORLD CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>LAUSANNE, Switzerland 1997-03-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results at the</p>
<p>world figure skating championships on Saturday:</p>
<p>Women's final</p>
<p>1. Tara Lipinski (U.S.) 2.5 factored placements</p>
<p>2. Michelle Kwan (U.S.) 3.0</p>
<p>3. Vanessa Gusmeroli (France) 5.0</p>
<p>4. Irina Slutskaya (Russia) 6.0</p>
<p>5. Maria Butyrskaya (Russia) 6.5</p>
<p>6. Laetitia Hubert (France) 10.5</p>
<p>7. Krisztina Czako (Hungary) 10.5</p>
<p>8. Julia Lautowa (Austria) 11.5</p>
<p>9. Yulia Lavranchuk (Ukraine) 14.5</p>
<p>10. Eva-Maria Fitze (Germany) 17.0</p>
<p>11. Joanne Carter (Australia) 17.0</p>
<p>12. Olga Markova (Russia) 18.5</p>
<p>13. Nicole Bobek (U.S.) 19.0</p>
<p>14. Zuzanna Szwed (Poland) 20.0</p>
<p>15. Lucinda Ruh (Switzerland) 22.0</p>
<p>16. Lenka Kulovana (Czech Republic) 25.0</p>
