<p>Withdrew injured: Susan Humphreys (Canada) 10.5</p>
<p>Did not qualify for final: Chen Lu (China), Tony Sabrina</p>
<p>Bombardieri (Italy), Zuzana Paurova (Slovakia), Marta Andrade</p>
<p>(Spain), Ivana Jakupcevic (Slovakia), Sofia Penkova (Bulgaria).</p>
